  - 1. Click, Drag, Move
  - 2. Reset the view
  homeBodies:
  - Tap to press a button or choose a card. Inside an experience, hold and push the
    stylus away to zoom in, pull it back to zoom out.
  - Tap to press a button, choose a card and tap Load. Dragging and turning work
    inside an experience.
  - Tap to press a button. Inside an experience, tap on empty space to bring the
    view back to the start.
  alwaysHome: 1
